  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"对于SPI订阅任务，支持「App维度」/「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表；对于RDS订阅任务，支持「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表，暂不支持「App维度」。关键配合接口为【获取APP Access Token】。\",\"id\":\"subscribe.accounts.remove\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/subscribe/accounts/remove/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1818567121016212\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_app_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\",\"reason\":\"请求需要应用级token，通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取APP Access Token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1818567121016212\",\"title\":\"取消 Adv 订阅\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HQLUQ1VD\">对于SPI订阅任务，支持「App维度」/「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-KfYV3ngy\">对于RDS订阅任务，支持「订阅任务维度」管理推送账户列表，暂不支持「App维度」</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201764043777745997%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-NxClqQOk\" id=\"h346b9f0-KBNXh2DI\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-FYQvZAS6\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/subscribe/accounts/remove/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/subscribe/accounts/remove/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1818567121016212\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-i910izna\" id=\"h346b9f0-lNUAZAe7\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-KFiViP6L\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-EFQPLSAe\" id=\"h346b9f0-uiuVJIPu\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">App-Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-T4VTzkuE\">应用级token，区别于普通的Access Token，通过【<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1713655428885516\">获取APP Access Token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pDqL8j14\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">APP-Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-L9Txqm5k\" id=\"h346b9f0-r94YitKO\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1I6x9CwB\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">开放平台调用MAP所使用的APPID</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_task_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Wpd5EpTx\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">订阅任务ID</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-IdTtiWE7\">注意：当subscribe_package_type=<code>TASK</code>时生效且必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">core_user_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qiBfzxha\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">授权用户ID</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_ids</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5wleMb3g\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">需要添加的账户id，一次请求最大支持500个账户</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_package_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rwmWJeco\">自定义订阅账户包类型，可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-kTEa9141\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-N9P7E2EQ\"><code>APP</code> APP维度</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YmrY5bKK\"><code>TASK</code>订阅任务维度（默认）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">添加的账户类型，</span>可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-TZXFP7kX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HJ0DkMgO\"><code>ADVERTISER</code> 客户（默认）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-S9Ggb77n\"><code>AGENT</code> 代理商</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-170mTK5G\"><code>旧版巨量引擎工作台</code> 旧版巨量引擎工作台</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kPbmqFeX\"><code>升级版巨量引擎工作台</code> 升级版巨量引擎工作台</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6nmi1UkK\" id=\"h346b9f0-VWRrB8UN\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse